          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuleghapatana kwa Jeremia na mkohani Pashuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana mkohani Pashuri mwana wa Imeri, uo orekoghe m'baa wa Hekalu ya BWANA oresikireghe malagho nereghilodereghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Pashuri ukanikaba na kunifunganya na vilingo verekoghe Mbenge ya Wandu ya lughu aho Hekalunyi ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakesho yaro, Pashuri uendanifungua ngamzera, “BWANA ndewangagha irina jako Pashuri, ela wadajiwanga ‘Wowa Kula Andu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu BWANA waghamba, ‘Ola nichakubonya kuchulo ni wowa, na waghenyi wako wori wikuobuo. Kuchawiwona waghenyi wako wikibwaghwa kwa lufu ni wamaiza wawo; sena nichawingira wandu wa Juda mikonunyi kwa mzuri wa Babuloni, nao uchawidwa wunyika cha Babuloni na kuwibwagha kwa lufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aighu ya agho, nichaneka wamaiza wenyu mali rose ra ughu muzi: fwaida raro rose, zawadi rose winekelo, na mashamo ghose gha wazuri wa Juda wichaghiwada na kughidwa wunyika noko cha Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oho Pashuri chiaimweri na wose wikaiagha nyumbenyi kwako, mchadwalwa wunyika cha Babuloni; kuchaghenda na kufuya aho, kurikilo aho, chiaimweri na waghenyi wako awo kwawilodera tee.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremia kumlalamikia BWANA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
